{
  "category": "techguns:ore_drills",
  "icon": "techguns:ore_drill_controller",
  "name": "Ore Drill Multiblock",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Ore drills are multiblock machines and general $(l:powered_machines/machine_mechanics)machine mechanics$(/l) apply. Ore drills can be built in different sizes and rotations but must be adjacent to an ore cluster. There are 5 different block types involved in building an ore drill. The formulas for calculating output and power are explained $(l:ore_drills/ore_clusters#formulas)here$(/l)."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "techguns:ore_drill_frame",
      "recipe2": "techguns:ore_drill_scaffold"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "techguns:ore_drill_rod",
      "recipe2": "techguns:ore_drill_engine"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "techguns:ore_drill_controller",
      "text": "To start building an ore drill find an $(l:ore_drills/ore_clusters)ore cluster$(/l) and start with placing down the rod(s). To form the multiblock, $(thing)right+click$() the controller."
    },
